Ingredients:

   - 10 Chiles Puya (lightly fried alone)
   - 1 whole garlic clove (minced into very small pieces, lightly fried
   alone)
   - 2 tablespoons sesame seeds (ajonjol=C3=AD) (can be fried with pepitas)
   - 2 tablespoons pumpkin seeds (pepitas)
   - 2 tablespoons peanuts (cacahuates) (lightly fried alone)
   - Olive oil
   - Salt to taste

Instructions:

   1.

   *Prepare the Ingredients:*
   - Lightly fry the 10 Chiles Puya alone.
      - Mince the garlic clove into very small pieces and lightly fry it
      alone.
      - Lightly fry the peanuts (cacahuates) alone.
      - Fry the sesame seeds (ajonjol=C3=AD) together with the pumpkin seed=
s
      (pepitas).
   2.

   *Blend the Ingredients:*
   - Blend the Chiles Puya on their own until very smooth.
      - Loosely blend the peanuts (cacahuates).
   3.

   *Combine and Store:*
